2135 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Runwayz decided to re\055invest in their software product at a time where AI design and development tooling could get us from 0\0551 faster than ever\056\n\nImmediately this created a new risk\072 design and discovery becoming a bottleneck for development\056\n\nMy question as Head of Product\072 how do we let development move as fast as possible without design slowing it down\054 or worse\054 without AI stripping the Runwayz brand of authenticity\077)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 2136 0 R
     /Pg 324 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
