2146 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Our current pipeline wasn\031t bad\054 it was simple\056 Our design system lived in Figma\054 our primary source of truth for all new designs\054 components and variables\056\n\nTranslating frames to our production environment was also simple \055 leveraging Figma\031s dev mode to pull all necessary CSS then rebuilding within our IDE\056\n\nOur engineering team was already leveraging Claude Code to empower development\056 I needed to create a flexible system that would allow our codebase to communicate with our design system\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 2147 0 R
     /Pg 426 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

