2157 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My first task was to teach Claude about Runwayz\056 If Claude understands the brand\054 there would be less back and forth between myself and an AI model\056\n\nI did this by creating a skill specific to the Runwayz brand\054 embedded context that Claude could reference when making decisions\056\n\nMy hypothesis was that\054 if this skill lived within our codebase\054 we could  generate UI directly\054 potentially removing the need for Figma at all\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 2158 0 R
     /Pg 534 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
