2164 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This was my first mistake\056 Claude \053 skills was effective at producing output fast\054 but that output was generic and hard to iterate on\056\n\nI needed a way to leverage Claude and Figma simultaneously\054 without sacrificing the time it takes for a developer to recreate a frame twice\056\n\nThat was when I discovered the Figma MCP server\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 2165 0 R
     /Pg 648 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
