2175 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Leveraging the MCP server immediately made the pipeline more flexible\056 I was able to iterate much faster than normal\054 and generating states for components was incredibly effective\056\n\nHowever\054 I still couldn\031t create enough distance between myself and AI\056 Despite my progress\054 the designs still had inauthentic quality to them\056\n\nI needed some more layers to my system\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
