  << /ActualText (Once I had our new design pipeline in a good place\054 our brand designer and CEO came to me with a new vision for the Runwayz brand\056\n\nNormally this would be a massive undertaking but I figured that\054 since I was already experimenting with an AI\055empowered pipeline\054 I could try and overhaul our design system using the same approach\056 \n\nThis is when things really got interesting\056)
