2269 0 obj
  << /ActualText (First\054 I created an audit comparison between our current system and the proposed one\054 checking for inconsistencies and gaps that would need to be filled\056\n\nFrom there\054 I was able to leverage the Claude \222 Figma pipeline to create a fully accessible color palette\054 and was able to replace all of our variables in Figma in one fell swoop\056\n\nFinally\054 I ran a final audit against the newly created variables to create a separate dark mode palette\056 Once those were done\054 I was able to update our component library from Claude\056\n\nThe whole process took me less than a day\056   )
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 2270 0 R
     /Pg 1808 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
