2306 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As I continue to experiment with and iterate on this model\054 it is important to emphasize the value of human touch points throughout the process\056\n\nThe pipeline is great for quick wins\054 iterations\054 audits\054 cleanup and high\055level discovery\056 The human is still very necessary at every step\056\n\nWhen done in the right way\054 AI can truly unlock deep potential on design teams at scale\056)
